Lab 5: Create Projects in Ansible
Objectives
By the end of this lab, you will be able to:

• Understand the concept of Ansible projects and their role in automation workflows • Create and configure a new project in Ansible Automation Controller • Link an Ansible project to a Git repository for version control • Synchronize project content from a remote Git repository • Verify project creation and synchronization status • Troubleshoot common project creation and synchronization issues

